cff-version: 1.2.0
title: iot-pcap-pipeline
message: If you use this software, please cite it and the CICIoMT2024 dataset.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Framba
    given-names: Leo
    alias: leoframba
    email: 89568350+leoframba@users.noreply.github.com
repository-code: https://github.com/leoframba/iot-pcap-pipeline
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-12"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end IoMT intrusion detection system that converts raw network
  PCAPs into deterministic packet-window features, scores them with a
  frozen HistGradientBoosting model, and serves PCAP-level BENIGN/ATTACK
  predictions through a Dockerized FastAPI service on Google Vertex AI.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - intrusion-detection
  - iomt
  - pcap
  - machine-learning
  - fastapi
  - vertex-ai
